<title>ESTONIA: ESTONIA-NRG TO MEET ECONOMY MINISTRY.</title>
<headline>ESTONIA-NRG TO MEET ECONOMY MINISTRY.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>David Peterson, the head of U.S. electricity group NRG, part of Northern States Power, is on July 17 to meet Economy Minister Jaak Leimann to discuss energy privatisation, domestic news agency ETA said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>NRG has already signed a letter of intent to form a joint venture based on the two largest power stations.</p>
<p>State-owned Eest Energia will have 51 percent of the venture and 49 percent by NRG.</p>
<p>Peterson will also meet the head of Eesti Energia, Uudo-Rein Lehtse.</p>
<p>-- Riga newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
</text>
